{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41925","headline":"秋夕病中作 · 李中","name":"秋夕病中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧病当秋夕，悠悠枕上情。\n不堪抛月色，无计避虫声。\n煎药惟忧澁，停灯又怕明。\n晓临清监里，应有白髭生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}